1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:03,580
(Penny:)Oh, please, it's not a time machine.
If anything, it looks like...

2
00:00:03,743 --> 00:00:06,663
(Penny:)...something Elton John would drive
through the Everglades.

3
00:00:12,502 --> 00:00:14,332
(Sheldon:)It only moves in time.

4
00:00:14,504 --> 00:00:17,844
(Sheldon:)It would be worse than useless
in a swamp.

5
00:00:22,679 --> 00:00:27,099
(Penny:)Pathetic. All of you, completely pathetic.

6
